# ☕ Cafe Shop Backend API

This is the backend API for the Cafe Shop project built with **Laravel**. It provides CRUD operations for managing:

- 🧾 Orders
- 📋 Categories
- 🍽️ Menu Items
- 📦 Order Items

---

## 🚀 Features

- Full RESTful CRUD for:
  - Categories
  - Menu Items
  - Orders
  - Order Items



---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Framework:** Laravel 10+
- **Database:**  MySQL


---
## 📡 API Endpoints Overview

### 🔸 Categories
- `GET /api/categories`
- `POST /api/categories`
- `GET /api/categories/{id}`
- `PUT /api/categories/{id}`
- `DELETE /api/categories/{id}`

### 🔸 Menu Items
- `GET /api/menus`
- `POST /api/menus`
- `GET /api/menus/{id}`
- `PUT /api/menus/{id}`
- `DELETE /api/menus/{id}`

### 🔸 Orders
- `GET /api/orders`
- `POST /api/orders`
- `GET /api/orders/{id}`
- `PUT /api/orders/{id}`
- `DELETE /api/orders/{id}`

### 🔸 Order Items
- `GET /api/order-items`
- `POST /api/order-items`
- `GET /api/order-items/{id}`
- `PUT /api/order-items/{id}`
- `DELETE /api/order-items/{id}`


## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/cafe-shop-api.git
cd cafe-shop-api

### 2. composer install

### 3. cp .env.example .env
php artisan key:generate

### 4. Then update your  .env file with the correct database credentials

### 5. Run migration -> ` php artisan migrate`

### 6. Serve the App-> `php artisan serve`



